# The win condition, whole: an ark comes down on one territory and an ark leaves from another.
#
# **Sean, 2026-09-20**: *win condition is to deploy my ark to one space and launch an ark from a
# different space.* **Nothing in the game could do this two days ago.** An ark comes down once; a
# citizen is not a `unit`, so `move` cannot carry one; and only a settlement can build. **The
# pioneer is the whole route** - built where the ark landed, walked across a border, and spent on
# ground that had nobody on it.
#
# **This is the test the loop test cannot be.**
# `an-ark-lands-a-planet-is-developed-and-an-ark-leaves` launches from the territory the ark came
# down on, and would satisfy a rule that said *an ark leaves*. **The ark here leaves from `place-4`,
# the orbit of the second territory**, and every extractor and every citizen under it came out of
# the pioneer.
#
# ## Four turns, and what each is for
#
# **Turn one is the landing.** The ark becomes two extractors and two citizens; one labour mines
# six food and nothing eats it, because a citizen off an ark owes no meal yet - so all six go to
# `breed` and the settlement is four by the end of it.
#
# **Turn two is the pioneer.** Four labours: food to stay alive, metal to build from, the pioneer
# itself, and one spare. It walks the border the same turn it is made, because everything made here
# arrives at full capability.
#
# **Turn three is two settlements at once, and that is the turn that is easy to get wrong.** The
# first one still eats every turn whether or not anything interesting is happening to it - a turn
# that forgets it loses six citizens to `perish` and the arc with them. **The ground that never
# built anything is the ground that has to keep being fed.**
#
# **Turn four is the launch**, from the second territory: metal out of the ground, an energy
# extractor built from it, energy out of the ground, and an ark built from the three.
#
# ## What the end state says
#
# **Two settlements, one ark in orbit above the second, and nothing stored anywhere.** Six citizens
# on the first territory and four on the second, all of them hungry, and five energy and four metal
# lying loose that the next turn's end would take. **A launch is not a departure**; it is a thing
# built, and what happens to the people who built it is the next turn's problem.
#
# **The second territory keeps its food extractor unworked at `working:1`** - it was worked in turn
# three and the turn gave it back - while its metal and energy extractors are spent. That asymmetry
# is the whole record of which turn did what.

{test name:a-second-settlement-launches-the-ark-the-first-could-not}

{given}
{territory id:1 name:territory-1}
{place id:1 of:territory-1 layer:surface name:place-1}
{place id:2 of:territory-1 layer:orbit name:place-2}
{territory id:2 name:territory-2}
{place id:3 of:territory-2 layer:surface name:place-3}
{place id:4 of:territory-2 layer:orbit name:place-4}
{adjacency id:1 from:territory-1 to:territory-2}
{capacity of:deposit for:extractor what:resource per:place} -> 1
{provides kind:place what:berth} -> 6
{consumes kind:pioneer what:berth} -> 1
{deposit where:place-1 what:metal density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-1 what:food density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-3 what:metal density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-3 what:food density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-3 what:energy density:6} -> 1
{ark where:place-2 moving:1 gathering:1} -> 1

{when}
{deploy where:place-2 what:ark}
{toil where:place-1}
{work where:place-1 what:food}
{end-turn}
{toil where:place-1}
{work where:place-1 what:food}
{work where:place-1 what:metal}
{build-pioneer where:place-1}
{move what:pioneer from:place-1 to:place-3}
{end-turn}
{deploy where:place-3 what:pioneer}
{toil where:place-1}
{work where:place-1 what:food}
{toil where:place-3}
{work where:place-3 what:food}
{end-turn}
{toil where:place-3}
{work where:place-3 what:metal}
{build-extractor where:place-3 what:energy}
{work where:place-3 what:energy}
{launch where:place-3}

{then}
{adjacency id:1 from:territory-1 to:territory-2}
{ark where:place-4 moving:1 gathering:1} -> 1
{capacity of:deposit for:extractor what:metal per:place} -> 1
{capacity of:deposit for:extractor what:food per:place} -> 1
{capacity of:deposit for:extractor what:energy per:place} -> 1
{citizen where:place-1 hungry:1 bearing:1 laboring:1} -> 6
{citizen where:place-3 hungry:1 bearing:1 laboring:0} -> 4
{consumes kind:pioneer what:berth} -> 1
{deposit where:place-1 what:metal density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-1 what:food density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-3 what:metal density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-3 what:food density:6} -> 1
{deposit where:place-3 what:energy density:6} -> 1
{energy where:place-3} -> 5
{extractor where:place-1 what:metal working:1} -> 1
{extractor where:place-1 what:food working:1} -> 1
{extractor where:place-3 what:metal working:0} -> 1
{extractor where:place-3 what:food working:1} -> 1
{extractor where:place-3 what:energy working:0} -> 1
{metal where:place-3} -> 4
{place id:1 of:territory-1 layer:surface name:place-1}
{place id:2 of:territory-1 layer:orbit name:place-2}
